WEBVTT

01:30.330 --> 01:34.860
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.120 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 22]

01:42.229 --> 01:43.229
He's gone indeed.

01:45.920 --> 01:47.039
He must've gotten injured when fighting

01:47.039 --> 01:48.500
the Dreamshard Immortal,

01:49.350 --> 01:51.009
which depleted all his power.

01:51.460 --> 01:53.120
Everyone spread out and search carefully.

01:53.120 --> 01:53.870
Capturing the Demon King

01:53.870 --> 01:55.810
brings far greater merit
than catching thousands of minor demons.

01:55.810 --> 01:56.350
Go!

01:56.590 --> 01:57.150
Yes!

02:04.960 --> 02:05.850
Old crow.

02:07.560 --> 02:08.690
You're back.

02:09.630 --> 02:11.300
Why are they still alive?

02:12.950 --> 02:15.420
Didn't you say you would kill them all,

02:15.450 --> 02:16.470
turning them into living corpses

02:16.470 --> 02:18.270
to be delivered to His Lordship?

02:20.540 --> 02:22.010
What nonsense are you talking about?

02:22.010 --> 02:23.910
Fine.
I'll take it as I didn't see anything.

02:23.910 --> 02:25.040
Get to work quickly.

02:25.990 --> 02:26.970
Remember,

02:27.360 --> 02:28.920
don't beat them up too badly.

02:28.920 --> 02:31.950
If their flesh and bones
stick to their clothes,

02:31.980 --> 02:33.280
it'd be hard to sort out.

02:33.280 --> 02:33.880
Wu Huan,

02:34.630 --> 02:36.050
what's she talking about?

02:36.050 --> 02:37.170
We're on the same side.

02:37.170 --> 02:39.170
That's right. We're on the same side.

02:39.170 --> 02:41.170
Let's take out that official first.

02:56.310 --> 02:57.800
Wu Huan, help out!

02:57.800 --> 02:59.280
You're just waiting to reap the benefits!

02:59.280 --> 03:00.210
Go! Quick!

03:09.190 --> 03:09.750
You!

03:12.000 --> 03:12.840
Don't be too brutal!

03:12.840 --> 03:13.870
Don't damage the heart!

03:13.870 --> 03:16.130
Stir-fried human heart tastes the best!

03:16.530 --> 03:17.590
You old demon!

03:17.680 --> 03:19.480
I'm going to make you
into a stew!

03:19.680 --> 03:20.140
Attack!

03:26.360 --> 03:27.280
It was you

03:27.400 --> 03:28.560
who tricked us...

03:29.320 --> 03:30.600
I didn't trick you!

03:44.670 --> 03:45.850
Well done, Wu Huan.

03:45.880 --> 03:48.010
His Lordship will reward you greatly.

03:48.800 --> 03:49.490
Wu Huan.

03:50.260 --> 03:51.100
Nicely done.

03:54.120 --> 03:54.720
Very well.

03:55.910 --> 03:57.240
You'll all pay for this!

04:00.000 --> 04:00.870
My Lord.

04:01.120 --> 04:02.130
As for the rest,

04:02.150 --> 04:04.330
let's turn them into barbecue.

04:05.000 --> 04:05.730
Sounds good.

04:06.130 --> 04:08.600
These Feiyu Guards
all have cultivation within them.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.460
They are indeed
better than ordinary humans

04:10.460 --> 04:11.480
for nourishment.

04:24.630 --> 04:25.950
Without a scratch.

04:26.630 --> 04:27.390
We've won.

04:30.530 --> 04:32.330
My power is completely drained.

04:32.390 --> 04:33.270
I'm starving.

04:33.640 --> 04:35.900
My Lord, could you make something to eat?

04:49.190 --> 04:50.050
Just this once.

04:51.300 --> 04:53.300
You cannot steal them in the future.

04:57.120 --> 04:59.390
Is your life
only worth a few bamboo shoots?

04:59.390 --> 05:00.750
I wouldn't have saved you if I'd known.

05:00.750 --> 05:02.430
You weren't the one who saved me.

05:02.430 --> 05:04.120
It was His Lordship who saved me.

05:04.120 --> 05:04.980
Right, My Lord?

05:06.080 --> 05:07.190
Fine.

05:09.750 --> 05:11.160
What has Heiwu been up to?

05:15.730 --> 05:17.450
His Lordship is dead!

05:19.970 --> 05:21.300
That's what Heiwu said.

05:23.070 --> 05:24.680
The demon clan has no leader!

05:25.320 --> 05:27.980
A new Monarch of All Demons
must be established.

05:28.190 --> 05:31.710
Let's gather all great demons
to Demons' Valley

05:31.800 --> 05:33.530
to select a new Demon King.

05:33.720 --> 05:35.250
He lures all the demons over

05:35.560 --> 05:38.490
to present them as gifts
to the Feiyu Guard, isn't he?

05:39.020 --> 05:40.450
Where are they now?

05:40.720 --> 05:42.580
Some have already been captured.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.030
The rest of them

05:44.120 --> 05:45.090
went into hiding in different places,

05:45.090 --> 05:46.350
scattered all around.

05:47.600 --> 05:49.550
I'll gather everyone right away

05:49.570 --> 05:51.270
to follow My Lord to reclaim Youning Cave.

05:51.270 --> 05:52.310
I'll go too.

05:52.380 --> 05:54.240
I know where Xiaohu
and the Crane are hiding.

05:54.240 --> 05:54.770
Let's go.

05:56.270 --> 05:57.400
Don't be impulsive.

05:57.560 --> 05:58.830
Since My Lord has returned,

05:58.830 --> 06:00.160
there's no need to rush.

06:00.430 --> 06:00.800
I-It

06:01.040 --> 06:01.850
is urgent!

06:02.160 --> 06:03.290
Is My Lord in no rush?

06:05.600 --> 06:06.510
Heiwu,

06:06.630 --> 06:08.270
although he betrayed the demons,

06:08.270 --> 06:10.040
he is different from the human Feiyu Guard

06:10.040 --> 06:12.090
and the human demon hunters.

06:12.110 --> 06:13.600
If we fight to the death,

06:13.600 --> 06:14.680
demons killing demons,

06:14.680 --> 06:16.740
wouldn't that just amuse the humans?

06:19.270 --> 06:20.400
So what should we do?

06:22.250 --> 06:23.620
My Lord is back.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.830
It's not our place to come up with plans.

06:25.830 --> 06:26.370
Yes.

06:28.830 --> 06:30.290
You rest and recover first.

06:30.290 --> 06:31.820
I'll figure something out.

06:46.430 --> 06:46.950
Go away.

07:16.960 --> 07:18.740
You and an entire squad of Feiyu Guards

07:18.740 --> 07:20.710
couldn't even handle this simple task?

07:20.710 --> 07:21.420
My Lord.

07:22.250 --> 07:23.450
Hong Ye has returned.

07:23.700 --> 07:25.070
His power has increased greatly.

07:25.070 --> 07:26.400
None of us are his match.

07:26.510 --> 07:27.320
Hong Ye?

07:31.310 --> 07:32.280
No wonder.

07:32.920 --> 07:33.680
No wonder.

07:34.870 --> 07:36.330
You've been through a lot.

07:40.090 --> 07:41.580
So how did you make it back?

07:43.240 --> 07:44.250
It was Hong Ye.

07:45.430 --> 07:47.310
He asked me to deliver a message to you.

07:47.310 --> 07:48.060
He said

07:48.120 --> 07:50.060
he's willing to follow your advice

07:50.440 --> 07:52.440
and won't be soft-hearted anymore.

07:53.040 --> 07:54.030
He also said

07:54.560 --> 07:56.420
for what we've done to the demons,

07:57.010 --> 07:59.210
he'll make us pay back a thousandfold.

08:04.740 --> 08:05.530
My Lord.

08:06.560 --> 08:08.030
Should we move out of Youning Cave first

08:08.030 --> 08:09.230
to lie low for a while?

08:10.000 --> 08:11.520
Are you scared?

08:12.000 --> 08:12.600
No.

08:13.310 --> 08:14.910
Not with you here, My Lord.

08:15.390 --> 08:17.250
He's already determined to kill.

08:17.310 --> 08:18.840
What's the point of hiding?

08:22.680 --> 08:23.630
Go to Pingjiang

08:23.680 --> 08:25.210
and contact the Feiyu Guard.

08:25.210 --> 08:26.940
Tell them Hong Ye has returned.

08:26.980 --> 08:29.080
Ask them to send more experts immediately

08:29.080 --> 08:31.630
to coordinate with us
from both inside and outside.

08:31.630 --> 08:32.630
Go now!

08:34.120 --> 08:34.840
Yes.

08:39.330 --> 08:40.799
This is my only option

08:41.510 --> 08:43.000
to save the demons.

08:44.270 --> 08:46.070
Heiwu is different from Wu Huan.

08:46.670 --> 08:49.130
He'll likely notice
you've lost your power.

08:50.160 --> 08:52.310
So we need a foolproof plan

08:53.110 --> 08:54.510
before confronting him.

08:56.270 --> 08:57.070
I understand.

09:10.010 --> 09:11.470
Don't even think about it.

09:12.770 --> 09:14.570
Although I've lost my power now,

09:15.270 --> 09:17.620
if I forcibly summon my demonic energy,

09:18.080 --> 09:18.550
perhaps I could still—

09:18.550 --> 09:19.350
No, you can't.

09:20.440 --> 09:21.440
The most urgent matter now

09:21.440 --> 09:22.750
is to eliminate Heiwu

09:23.170 --> 09:24.680
and save the demons.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.360
This is my only option.

09:30.870 --> 09:31.790
Trust me,

09:32.610 --> 09:34.380
this surely isn't the only way.

09:35.450 --> 09:36.780
Let's wait a bit longer.

09:37.240 --> 09:38.240
Let's think more.

09:43.420 --> 09:45.550
Let's find Xiao Ming and Xiao Mu first.

09:50.940 --> 09:51.490
Sure.

09:52.600 --> 09:54.130
Heiwu is a coward by nature.

09:54.240 --> 09:56.570
Before he figures out our true situation,

09:56.620 --> 09:58.220
he won't make any rash moves.

09:58.270 --> 10:00.200
He's probably on guard against us.

10:06.040 --> 10:07.220
All right.

10:07.550 --> 10:10.550
Too much worrying will give you wrinkles.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.270
Then you'll truly become an old demon.

10:12.270 --> 10:13.330
I won't allow that.

10:30.940 --> 10:31.510
No.

10:36.140 --> 10:39.140
Xiao Ming fears that there are mice
in Chengxiang Sea.

11:04.240 --> 11:05.240
Luoluo!

11:05.240 --> 11:06.080
Hurry!

11:11.410 --> 11:12.210
Slow down.

11:22.780 --> 11:24.040
It's not for you to eat.

11:52.210 --> 11:54.260
Some are burnt, and some are cold.

11:54.390 --> 11:57.190
Xiao Ming would be more upset than me
if he saw this.

12:01.510 --> 12:02.340
It seems

12:02.840 --> 12:04.550
we have to use our last resort.

12:08.360 --> 12:09.420
That's all, right?

12:09.480 --> 12:10.410
That's all.

12:10.790 --> 12:13.320
All the catnip
from around here is right here.

12:14.450 --> 12:15.940
Stop eating.

12:34.320 --> 12:34.870
My Lord!

12:53.210 --> 12:53.600
My...

12:53.790 --> 12:54.360
My Lord.

12:54.870 --> 12:55.390
Xiao Mu.

12:58.240 --> 12:58.920
My Lord!

12:59.380 --> 12:59.750
My...

13:01.080 --> 13:02.550
I'm too ashamed to face My Lord.

13:02.550 --> 13:03.350
You should...

13:04.000 --> 13:04.790
Stand up first.

13:04.790 --> 13:05.390
My Lord,

13:05.790 --> 13:06.990
you're finally back!

13:07.000 --> 13:09.150
We've been longing for your return,
My Lord.

13:09.150 --> 13:10.790
Xiao Ming has missed you so much.

13:10.790 --> 13:12.480
Heiwu told all the minor demons

13:12.480 --> 13:14.550
that you were killed
by the Dreamshard Immortal.

13:14.550 --> 13:15.960
But Xiao Ming didn't believe it.

13:15.960 --> 13:17.960
I kept trying to sense you with my power,

13:17.960 --> 13:19.620
but I couldn't feel anything.

13:20.320 --> 13:21.600
I was completely out of options,

13:21.600 --> 13:22.790
so I had to go to the human realm

13:22.790 --> 13:24.150
and find a deity statue.

13:24.150 --> 13:26.670
I made offerings
and prayed to it every day.

13:26.670 --> 13:27.920
He's so noisy.

13:28.080 --> 13:29.530
But it feels familiar.

13:30.360 --> 13:32.440
My Lord, how are you?

13:32.460 --> 13:34.270
Has the poison in your body been cured?

13:34.270 --> 13:34.960
I'm fine.

13:35.790 --> 13:36.720
Call Xiao Mu out.

13:37.280 --> 13:38.320
All right.

13:48.960 --> 13:49.720
My Lord.

13:51.790 --> 13:52.750
Xiao Mu says

13:54.000 --> 13:56.160
he failed to protect Demons' Valley

13:56.400 --> 13:58.140
and was ambushed by Heiwu,

13:58.450 --> 14:00.510
causing Youning Cave to be occupied.

14:00.670 --> 14:02.270
He's too ashamed to face you.

14:02.370 --> 14:03.490
I don't blame him.

14:04.870 --> 14:06.150
I returned too late.

14:07.260 --> 14:08.590
Let me talk with Xiao Mu.

14:10.840 --> 14:11.480
My Lord.

14:12.320 --> 14:13.720
It's all Xiao Mu's fault.

14:13.840 --> 14:15.300
Now that you've returned,

14:15.440 --> 14:17.440
let's go reclaim Youning Cave immediately.

14:17.440 --> 14:19.080
I'm willing to die for this task.

14:19.080 --> 14:20.200
This matter requires
careful consideration.

14:20.200 --> 14:21.790
Xiao Ming is willing to risk his life too!

14:21.790 --> 14:22.620
My Lord!

14:25.790 --> 14:26.360
My Lord!

14:27.080 --> 14:27.990
Your power...

14:30.200 --> 14:30.670
Huh?

14:30.670 --> 14:31.390
What?

14:35.700 --> 14:36.120
Okay.

14:39.150 --> 14:41.320
She said to clean up all traces here.

14:41.320 --> 14:43.780
We'll meet
at the foot of the mountain later.

14:44.780 --> 14:45.860
She said that much?

14:45.890 --> 14:47.360
She also said you should eat all of these.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.360
It's good for you.

14:48.890 --> 14:49.490
Keep it up.

14:50.800 --> 14:52.010
It's a lot.

14:52.270 --> 14:52.910
Xiao Yao.

14:53.270 --> 14:54.680
You're the jinx!

14:54.870 --> 14:57.270
It's because of you
that My Lord is in this situation.

14:57.270 --> 14:58.660
I've already told you.

14:59.000 --> 15:01.720
I damaged my heart meridian
by using the Heart-Burning Incantation.

15:01.720 --> 15:03.000
What does it have to do with Xiao Yao?

15:03.000 --> 15:05.960
My Lord, stop defending Xiao Yao!

15:06.510 --> 15:07.710
If it weren't for her,

15:07.870 --> 15:09.390
why would you have gone
to the Realm of Mist and Void?

15:09.390 --> 15:10.480
If you hadn't gone
to the Realm of Mist and Void,

15:10.480 --> 15:12.440
how would you have ended up like this?

15:12.440 --> 15:14.710
If you hadn't lost your power, My Lord,

15:14.840 --> 15:16.030
how would I, no matter what,

15:16.030 --> 15:17.890
be unable to sense your presence?

15:18.200 --> 15:20.120
I once thought you had been...

15:20.120 --> 15:22.960
The Dreamshard Immortal was after me
right from the start.

15:22.960 --> 15:24.220
Even without Xiao Yao,

15:24.750 --> 15:27.150
she would have used
other means against me.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.600
You've been with me for so long.

15:29.600 --> 15:31.460
You should know better than this.

15:34.790 --> 15:35.440
My Lord.

15:36.870 --> 15:39.390
Although the Heart-Burning Incantation
is an ancient spell,

15:39.390 --> 15:41.120
judging by its name,
it only burns the heart,

15:41.120 --> 15:42.510
not your power.

15:43.000 --> 15:44.840
Perhaps your power, My Lord,

15:44.840 --> 15:46.550
is just suppressed within your body.

15:46.550 --> 15:47.410
It's possible!

15:48.670 --> 15:50.000
What are you looking at?

15:52.720 --> 15:55.760
I was just saying that to comfort you,
My Lord.

15:58.000 --> 15:59.400
The ancient demons texts

15:59.840 --> 16:01.570
are all sealed in Youning Cave.

16:02.550 --> 16:04.300
If we reclaim Youning Cave,

16:04.440 --> 16:06.720
we might find a solution.

16:07.320 --> 16:07.960
But...

16:10.320 --> 16:12.180
After you were attacked by Heiwu,

16:13.120 --> 16:14.850
how much of your power remains?

16:18.930 --> 16:19.860
Thirty percent.

16:21.120 --> 16:22.740
But if I recover to 60 percent,

16:22.740 --> 16:24.340
I can fight them to the death.

16:25.910 --> 16:27.310
Life is precious.

16:27.390 --> 16:29.100
Don't be so quick to risk your life.

16:29.100 --> 16:30.500
You need to use this more.

16:30.790 --> 16:31.430
Hey!

16:39.600 --> 16:40.790
The technique turning leaves into silver—

16:40.790 --> 16:42.030
can you still perform it?

16:42.030 --> 16:44.360
I only need 10 percent
of my power for that spell.

16:44.360 --> 16:46.030
Besides, at a time like this,

16:46.030 --> 16:46.830
why are you...

16:47.960 --> 16:48.670
why are you

16:48.670 --> 16:50.330
still so obsessed with money?

16:50.480 --> 16:52.540
Can't abandon my old trade after all.

16:54.120 --> 16:55.190
Come take a look!

16:55.360 --> 16:56.900
These are fine goods!

16:57.480 --> 16:58.410
Come take a look!

16:58.540 --> 16:59.350
Come!

16:59.440 --> 17:01.120
This is a divine weapon
for catching demons!

17:01.120 --> 17:01.780
Have a look!

17:03.670 --> 17:04.270
Xiao Yao.

17:09.660 --> 17:11.030
The things they sell here,

17:11.030 --> 17:12.480
as long as no one recites the spells,

17:12.480 --> 17:13.780
we are safe.

17:13.960 --> 17:14.690
Don't worry.

17:15.180 --> 17:16.030
Remember,

17:16.060 --> 17:17.210
you are...

17:17.680 --> 17:18.109
Human.

17:18.510 --> 17:18.839
Yes.

17:19.109 --> 17:19.640
Let's go.

17:22.880 --> 17:23.510
Sir,

17:23.530 --> 17:25.760
which of your demon-catching items
works best?

17:25.760 --> 17:26.349
Miss,

17:26.589 --> 17:28.640
everything I sell
is of the highest quality.

17:28.640 --> 17:30.790
But as for the best,

17:31.830 --> 17:34.110
it would be
these demon-repelling fireworks.

17:34.110 --> 17:36.370
You just need to pull it gently like this.

17:38.440 --> 17:39.680
These two friends of mine

17:39.680 --> 17:40.920
are afraid of fireworks.

17:40.920 --> 17:41.920
Please continue.

17:42.200 --> 17:43.410
Are you scared?

17:43.590 --> 17:46.720
-No, I'm not.
-There's colorful poison with peach wood.

17:47.240 --> 17:49.880
What happens if humans
accidentally inhale it?

17:49.880 --> 17:50.790
Don't worry, miss.

17:50.790 --> 17:52.720
This toxin is
our ancestral secret formula.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.960
It only affects demons.

17:53.960 --> 17:55.560
Humans won't be harmed by it.

17:55.790 --> 17:58.000
As they say, it's good
for both offense and defense.

17:58.000 --> 17:59.200
When ordinary demons encounter it,

17:59.200 --> 18:01.350
they definitely can't handle it,
I assure you.

18:01.350 --> 18:02.110
Is that all?

18:02.350 --> 18:03.440
There's more.

18:03.880 --> 18:06.210
But these fireworks are quite expensive.

18:15.720 --> 18:16.400
I have more.

18:16.420 --> 18:17.280
That's enough.

18:21.030 --> 18:22.020
As long as they work well,

18:22.020 --> 18:23.350
we'll take everything.

18:23.480 --> 18:25.210
They work well, absolutely!

18:25.230 --> 18:25.960
Miss, please wait a moment.

18:25.960 --> 18:28.220
I'll get them from the warehouse for you.

18:28.680 --> 18:29.070
Miss,

18:29.090 --> 18:30.000
take a look at my treasure.

18:30.000 --> 18:31.000
Have a look.

18:32.970 --> 18:33.790
This gentleman.

18:33.790 --> 18:35.000
I have some excellent items here.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.410
Would you like to take a look?

18:36.410 --> 18:36.830
Miss.

18:36.830 --> 18:37.160
Miss.

18:37.270 --> 18:37.810
Look at this.

18:37.810 --> 18:38.270
Miss.

18:38.290 --> 18:39.200
Look at this one.

18:39.200 --> 18:40.350
This is a genuine peach wood sword.

18:40.350 --> 18:41.000
All right, all right!

18:41.000 --> 18:41.480
I got it!

18:41.480 --> 18:43.010
One by one!

18:48.070 --> 18:49.870
Qiankun Demon Subduing Pestle.

18:51.920 --> 18:53.720
Cloud-Covering Ultimate Pill.

18:54.320 --> 18:55.290
Nine Chain Lock.

18:56.160 --> 18:57.760
Demon-Repelling Talisman.

18:58.510 --> 19:00.110
Underworld Nineteen-Whip.

19:02.110 --> 19:03.570
Body-Shattering Mirror.

19:09.070 --> 19:11.600
So, Xiao Yao,
what exactly are you thinking?

19:12.370 --> 19:13.270
You're planning to have My Lord

19:13.270 --> 19:16.070
use these human demon-catching tools
against...

19:16.080 --> 19:16.750
Heiwu.

19:17.240 --> 19:20.360
Heiwu betrayed demons
and gave them to humans for torturing.

19:20.360 --> 19:23.270
So we should let him have
a taste of human methods.

19:30.790 --> 19:31.790
That makes sense.

19:36.040 --> 19:38.060
My Lord, I won't comment on this for now.

19:38.060 --> 19:39.740
But Xiao Yao, I would like to ask you:

19:39.740 --> 19:41.470
do you think so little of Heiwu?

19:41.960 --> 19:43.000
No matter what,

19:43.000 --> 19:44.640
Heiwu is a great demon with
a thousand years of cultivation.

19:44.640 --> 19:46.000
Do you think these cheap trinkets

19:46.000 --> 19:47.480
can scare him?

19:49.000 --> 19:49.830
Let me ask you.

19:49.910 --> 19:51.640
What is Heiwu's true form?

19:51.670 --> 19:52.400
I don't know.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.700
An eagle, perhaps?

19:54.830 --> 19:55.680
What eagle?

19:56.200 --> 19:57.400
He's a horseshoe bat.

19:57.720 --> 19:58.920
You've cultivated into a great demon,

19:58.920 --> 20:00.440
yet you still love catnip,

20:00.440 --> 20:01.070
don't you?

20:01.440 --> 20:02.970
Heiwu is the same.

20:03.050 --> 20:05.310
Some innate traits can never be changed.

20:05.360 --> 20:08.000
These are specially prepared for him.

20:09.930 --> 20:11.440
How are you going to set it up?

20:11.440 --> 20:13.240
I need a group of friends to help.

20:14.490 --> 20:16.010
A group of friends?

20:18.830 --> 20:20.090
That's what happened.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.140
So

20:22.240 --> 20:24.900
Hong Ye's home
has been occupied by evil demons.

20:28.230 --> 20:29.480
I'd like to ask for your help

20:29.480 --> 20:30.880
to take back his home together.

20:30.880 --> 20:31.680
Will you help?

20:38.240 --> 20:39.150
Are you sure?

20:40.110 --> 20:40.550
Yeah.

20:43.880 --> 20:45.680
Has the message been delivered?

20:45.960 --> 20:47.590
It was sent 7 days ago.

20:47.610 --> 20:50.210
Then why hasn't
the Feiyu Guard responded yet?

20:50.440 --> 20:51.160
How about

20:51.590 --> 20:52.790
I go check on it again?

20:56.030 --> 20:57.490
That's Xiao Ming's voice.

20:59.630 --> 21:01.560
Wasn't that cat severely injured?

21:02.360 --> 21:04.090
How could it return so quickly?

21:04.270 --> 21:04.680
You!

21:04.910 --> 21:06.170
Go have a look quickly.

21:07.070 --> 21:07.510
I...

21:55.200 --> 21:55.680
My Lord.

21:56.210 --> 21:57.050
Lord Heiwu.

21:57.480 --> 21:58.310
Lord Heiwu!

22:00.620 --> 22:01.590
My Lord, bad news.

22:01.590 --> 22:02.790
Has Hong Ye returned?

22:02.790 --> 22:03.200
Yes.

22:03.960 --> 22:04.720
No, no.

22:05.500 --> 22:08.110
As soon as I went out,
my eyes were blinded by toxic fog.

22:08.110 --> 22:09.720
They must have ambushed me

22:09.720 --> 22:11.200
and set traps.

22:11.200 --> 22:13.400
I struggled greatly to fight my way out.

22:18.310 --> 22:19.990
This is a human weapon.

22:20.070 --> 22:22.440
Was it Hong Ye or humans who ambushed you?

22:23.920 --> 22:25.120
I didn't see clearly.

22:27.510 --> 22:28.070
My Lord.

22:40.440 --> 22:40.970
Let's go.

22:46.030 --> 22:46.690
There's...

22:47.160 --> 22:47.820
There's...

22:48.160 --> 22:48.820
There's...

22:49.400 --> 22:50.380
What is this?

23:12.880 --> 23:13.610
Who's there?

23:15.200 --> 23:15.840
Hong Ye...

23:16.310 --> 23:17.000
I got you.

23:17.000 --> 23:17.590
My Lord,

23:17.880 --> 23:18.680
it's me.

23:19.310 --> 23:19.920
Me...

23:21.790 --> 23:22.680
Heiwu.

23:24.030 --> 23:25.480
Come and meet your death.

23:26.440 --> 23:27.840
Come and meet your death.

23:29.160 --> 23:30.720
Come and meet your death.

23:32.830 --> 23:33.480
Heiwu.

23:34.620 --> 23:36.060
Come and meet your death.

23:38.000 --> 23:39.440
Come and

23:41.160 --> 23:42.780
meet your death.

23:43.200 --> 23:44.110
Meet...

23:45.030 --> 23:45.830
Your death...

23:46.480 --> 23:47.270
Death...

23:47.590 --> 23:48.160
Death.

23:56.000 --> 23:56.880
Hong Ye!

23:59.150 --> 24:01.690
It's a new world in Demons' Valley!

24:02.980 --> 24:04.990
You're no longer the Demon King!

24:07.920 --> 24:08.720
I am.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.000
Yes!

24:14.560 --> 24:15.800
Get ready to appear.

24:27.020 --> 24:27.880
Spread out evenly.

24:27.880 --> 24:28.940
Careful!

24:31.240 --> 24:32.450
Don't wobble.

24:32.720 --> 24:33.430
Good, good.

24:34.200 --> 24:34.790
Fly.

24:54.200 --> 24:54.790
Good, good.

24:54.790 --> 24:55.920
Hold steady!

24:55.920 --> 24:57.230
Right here!

24:58.240 --> 24:58.920
Don't move!

25:06.070 --> 25:06.750
Let's go!

25:06.750 --> 25:07.750
Retreat quickly! Go!

25:07.750 --> 25:08.480
Why retreat?

25:22.200 --> 25:23.660
Hong Ye is acting strange.

25:23.750 --> 25:25.280
Go check what's happening.

25:25.310 --> 25:25.680
Me?

25:25.830 --> 25:26.160
Yes.

25:26.380 --> 25:27.680
Do you think it should be me?

25:27.680 --> 25:28.220
Go!

25:39.110 --> 25:39.960
Do you know

25:40.200 --> 25:41.590
how many birds die

25:41.750 --> 25:43.350
under my cat claws every day?

25:53.090 --> 25:53.950
Hong Ye!

25:55.020 --> 25:56.680
I have the Feiyu Guard with me.

25:57.590 --> 25:59.240
You're just one demon alone.

26:00.070 --> 26:02.280
Stop putting on an act!

26:02.790 --> 26:03.310
Come on!

26:05.110 --> 26:05.590
Come on!

26:12.700 --> 26:13.430
To kill you,

26:14.750 --> 26:16.150
I alone am enough.

26:16.590 --> 26:19.520
Since you've removed yourself
from the demon registry,

26:19.520 --> 26:21.120
then on behalf of all demons,

26:22.200 --> 26:23.400
I'll end you.

26:29.550 --> 26:29.880
Go.

26:30.000 --> 26:31.110
Go, go.

26:57.780 --> 26:58.460
Heiwu.

27:00.350 --> 27:01.620
You are over.

27:30.550 --> 27:31.310
It's fake.

27:33.400 --> 27:34.660
You have no power left.

27:35.680 --> 27:36.940
It's just an illusion.

27:37.350 --> 27:39.050
All of it is fake!

27:50.630 --> 27:52.760
I've already sent the Zhuyu herb back.

27:53.510 --> 27:55.310
They'll keep their mouths shut.

27:57.070 --> 27:57.510
Xiao Yao.

27:57.510 --> 27:58.240
So?

27:58.240 --> 27:59.730
Isn't my idea pretty good?

27:59.960 --> 28:00.510
Yes.

28:00.640 --> 28:01.700
Come on, praise me.

28:03.050 --> 28:05.080
My Xiao Yao is so clever

28:05.100 --> 28:06.270
and resourceful.

28:09.350 --> 28:09.950
Oh, right.

28:10.480 --> 28:11.610
I have a gift for you.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.710
Close your eyes.

28:13.790 --> 28:14.510
Close them.

28:24.600 --> 28:25.240
Open them.

28:30.080 --> 28:33.280
Congratulations on
reclaiming Demons' Valley, My Lord.

28:39.160 --> 28:39.920
This is...

28:40.550 --> 28:42.810
My Lord has been overthinking lately.

28:42.890 --> 28:44.010
This jade comb

28:44.240 --> 28:46.640
will refresh your mind and relieve stress.

28:48.310 --> 28:49.310
Don't you like it?

28:51.920 --> 28:52.510
I do.

28:52.830 --> 28:53.750
My Lord.

29:00.680 --> 29:03.440
Are you two discussing marriage now?

29:03.680 --> 29:05.360
Don't talk nonsense.

29:05.590 --> 29:07.110
I'm not talking nonsense.

29:07.270 --> 29:08.750
According to human customs,

29:08.750 --> 29:11.480
a comb is a symbol of marriage.

29:11.830 --> 29:13.310
Don't take me for a fool.

29:13.310 --> 29:15.370
Let's talk about important matters.

29:15.790 --> 29:16.350
My Lord,

29:16.620 --> 29:18.430
everyone knows you're back.

29:18.500 --> 29:21.500
They're waiting outside
the cave entrance to see you.

29:24.350 --> 29:24.750
It's all your fault.

29:24.750 --> 29:25.400
It's all your fault.

29:25.400 --> 29:25.920
It's all because of you.

29:25.920 --> 29:26.400
You traitor.

29:26.400 --> 29:26.680
Right.

29:26.680 --> 29:27.810
You were the one

29:27.880 --> 29:29.400
who came to Demons' Valley
to capture demons.

29:29.400 --> 29:30.260
Let me tell you,

29:30.310 --> 29:32.030
my father despises traitors like you.

29:32.030 --> 29:32.640
It's all your fault.

29:32.640 --> 29:33.030
You deserve this!

29:33.030 --> 29:34.780
Look what trouble you've caused us.

29:34.780 --> 29:35.780
You're terrible!

29:36.160 --> 29:36.690
My Lord!

29:36.880 --> 29:37.550
My Lord!

29:37.550 --> 29:38.750
My Lord has returned!

29:38.900 --> 29:39.350
You're finally back!

29:39.350 --> 29:39.920
That's wonderful!

29:39.920 --> 29:40.650
You're back.

29:40.680 --> 29:41.160
You've returned.

29:41.160 --> 29:41.960
That's great!

29:41.960 --> 29:42.720
You're finally back!

29:42.720 --> 29:43.240
My Lord.

29:43.240 --> 29:45.270
-We missed you so much.
-We've been waiting for you for so long.

29:45.270 --> 29:46.480
Yes, Wu Huan was terrible!

29:46.480 --> 29:47.680
We missed you so much.

29:47.880 --> 29:48.580
Enough.

29:49.510 --> 29:50.680
My Lord has just returned.

29:50.680 --> 29:51.740
Speak one at a time.

29:52.000 --> 29:53.160
It was my fault.

29:54.070 --> 29:55.070
During this time,

29:55.400 --> 29:56.200
you all suffered because of me.

29:56.200 --> 29:56.960
No, no, My Lord.

29:56.960 --> 29:57.710
No rush.

29:58.030 --> 29:58.440
You go first.

29:58.440 --> 29:58.790
My Lord,

29:58.790 --> 29:59.750
I heard your power has increased greatly.

29:59.750 --> 30:00.560
Is that true?

30:00.750 --> 30:01.920
Of course it's true.

30:01.920 --> 30:03.720
My Lord, I heard that
in the Realm of Mist and Void,

30:03.720 --> 30:05.180
you defeated Dreamshard.

30:05.830 --> 30:06.740
Let me tell you all.

30:06.740 --> 30:09.200
My Lord is the person
I admire most in my life.

30:09.550 --> 30:10.000
Yes.

30:10.750 --> 30:11.240
I admire His Lordship too.

30:11.240 --> 30:11.720
Me too.

30:11.720 --> 30:12.680
Exactly.

30:12.680 --> 30:13.720
We all share the same sentiments.

30:13.720 --> 30:14.440
My Lord is the most powerful.

30:14.440 --> 30:15.480
Kitty, come here.

30:17.920 --> 30:18.720
What's wrong?

30:18.960 --> 30:20.180
Is Wu Huan's

30:20.310 --> 30:22.160
true form a crow?

30:23.370 --> 30:25.330
Isn't Wu Huan a crow?

30:26.240 --> 30:27.370
Look at his beak.

30:27.480 --> 30:28.880
And look at those talons.

30:29.680 --> 30:30.960
This is a falcon.

30:32.270 --> 30:33.440
The way you talk,

30:34.110 --> 30:34.680
it's like

30:34.680 --> 30:36.760
you're some kind of bird expert.

30:36.920 --> 30:38.650
I come from a family of hunters.

30:44.440 --> 30:48.270
An old bat managed to bewitch a falcon.

30:48.750 --> 30:50.070
How interesting.

30:52.070 --> 30:53.090
Let him down.

30:54.640 --> 30:55.000
What?

30:55.160 --> 30:55.790
Why?

30:56.790 --> 30:58.030
Why should we let him down?

30:58.030 --> 30:59.060
Let him down?

30:59.750 --> 31:00.400
Do you know

31:00.400 --> 31:02.270
how many demons
he has sacrificed to humans?

31:02.270 --> 31:03.110
Those demons

31:03.110 --> 31:04.720
suffered terrible torment.

31:04.720 --> 31:05.510
That's right!

31:05.510 --> 31:06.070
We can't let him go.

31:06.070 --> 31:06.680
Exactly.

31:06.680 --> 31:07.960
We can't let him down.

31:07.960 --> 31:08.720
Right, we can't release him.

31:08.720 --> 31:09.180
My Lord.

31:09.200 --> 31:09.590
My Lord.

31:09.590 --> 31:10.050
My Lord.

31:11.200 --> 31:13.550
Last night, Heiwu abandoned Wu Huan
and fled alone.

31:13.550 --> 31:15.590
Wu Huan now knows
his master's true nature.

31:15.590 --> 31:16.910
Demons' Valley has

31:17.160 --> 31:18.890
suffered repeated massacres.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.190
Killing one more

31:20.350 --> 31:22.150
would only be venting our anger.

31:22.510 --> 31:23.750
Better to let Wu Huan

31:24.480 --> 31:25.810
reflect on his actions.

31:27.310 --> 31:27.910
Xiao Ming,

31:28.460 --> 31:29.220
let him down.

31:29.640 --> 31:30.270
My Lord.

31:30.550 --> 31:31.280
Let him down.

31:33.750 --> 31:34.350
Yes.

31:37.690 --> 31:38.890
Listen to me, Wu Huan.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.360
If you dare harbor any

31:40.480 --> 31:42.540
evil thoughts about harming demons,

31:42.680 --> 31:44.270
even if My Lord punishes me,

31:44.590 --> 31:45.680
I will immediately,

31:45.680 --> 31:46.350
at once,

31:46.350 --> 31:47.810
kill you with my own hands.

31:54.000 --> 31:55.030
-My Lord.
-My Lord.

31:55.030 --> 31:55.350
My Lord.

31:55.350 --> 31:56.350
My Lord, please teach us.

31:56.350 --> 31:57.270
-Please teach us.
-We can beat him up.

31:57.270 --> 31:58.270
-Yeah.
-I can beat him up too.

31:58.270 --> 31:59.000
Teach us new techniques.

31:59.000 --> 32:01.060
-Please teach us.
-All right. Quiet.

32:01.400 --> 32:03.060
If you have questions, ask me.

32:03.160 --> 32:05.440
My Lord has taught me many techniques
on our journey.

32:05.440 --> 32:07.130
I know them too.

32:07.350 --> 32:08.480
My Lord worked through the night.

32:08.480 --> 32:09.480
Don't disturb him.

32:09.480 --> 32:10.730
Let him get some rest.

32:11.310 --> 32:11.790
My Lord,

32:12.200 --> 32:13.660
although during this time

32:13.690 --> 32:15.750
we've all been running for our lives,

32:15.760 --> 32:18.270
I'm the only one
who's been learning diligently.

32:18.270 --> 32:20.610
The new technique
I've practiced is called Earth Escape.

32:20.610 --> 32:22.420
Once I escape through it,
I travel a thousand miles in an instant.

32:22.420 --> 32:23.420
No one can find me.

32:23.910 --> 32:25.150
That's amazing!

32:25.640 --> 32:26.400
Show it to us.

32:31.240 --> 32:32.350
As for this Earth Escape Technique...

32:32.350 --> 32:33.000
Go ahead.

32:35.030 --> 32:35.510
Show us!

32:35.510 --> 32:36.240
Show us!

32:36.240 --> 32:36.640
Show us!

32:36.640 --> 32:37.100
Show us!

32:37.110 --> 32:37.640
Show us!

32:37.640 --> 32:38.720
Come on!

32:38.720 --> 32:40.270
Well...

32:40.930 --> 32:42.550
Has Wu Huan done it yet?

32:42.880 --> 32:44.140
Wu Huan hasn't done it.

32:44.460 --> 32:45.390
You should do it.

33:01.010 --> 33:02.360
I truly believe now

33:02.490 --> 33:05.290
that reading too many books
isn't all that useful.

33:05.510 --> 33:07.700
My Lord, you've read so extensively,

33:08.310 --> 33:09.480
thinking you might learn something,

33:09.480 --> 33:11.080
some way to deal with humans.

33:11.200 --> 33:12.480
Who would have thought that you

33:12.480 --> 33:14.920
would learn the Heart-Burning Incantation?

33:14.920 --> 33:17.030
Isn't that basically suicide?

33:17.880 --> 33:18.790
Besides,

33:19.110 --> 33:20.880
who in their right mind

33:20.880 --> 33:22.680
would develop such a technique?

33:22.790 --> 33:25.010
We can't find any demons who've used
the Heart-Burning Incantation,

33:25.010 --> 33:25.890
[Inside the Red Flame Fruit]

33:25.200 --> 33:27.070
let alone any documented cases.

33:25.890 --> 33:26.290
[is a hot liquid that makes it ripen
in a day.]

33:26.480 --> 33:27.690
[Not only the color is bright,
it also has powerful fire.]

33:28.480 --> 33:31.330
Who knows
if we can find a way to break the spell.

33:31.550 --> 33:33.110
But anyway,

33:33.270 --> 33:35.750
even if you're protecting Xiao Yao
in every way,

33:35.750 --> 33:37.730
this has something to do with her.

33:41.000 --> 33:42.000
My Lord,

33:42.000 --> 33:43.680
where are you going now?

33:52.480 --> 33:54.200
No one's watching over you anyway.

33:54.200 --> 33:55.130
I don't even know

33:55.400 --> 33:57.600
what you're so stubbornly clinging to.

33:58.590 --> 33:59.430
So,

33:59.720 --> 34:01.520
you reap what you sow.

34:02.270 --> 34:03.070
Wh-Wh-What

34:03.070 --> 34:03.960
a-a-are

34:03.960 --> 34:04.560
you doing?

34:04.640 --> 34:05.100
Luoluo.

34:09.590 --> 34:10.110
My Lord.

34:11.340 --> 34:12.170
Normally,

34:12.590 --> 34:14.590
you should be feeling drowsy by now.

34:14.800 --> 34:15.860
With My Lord back,

34:15.880 --> 34:17.920
the entire demon realm is energized.

34:17.920 --> 34:19.550
I can't be like before.

34:19.570 --> 34:21.030
I must make myself useful.

34:31.510 --> 34:33.070
You don't need to act like

34:33.670 --> 34:35.230
you're too good to kill me.

34:36.190 --> 34:38.710
Killing me to establish your authority
is inevitable.

34:38.710 --> 34:40.310
Stop this hypocritical act.

34:40.550 --> 34:42.210
I will ask you some questions.

34:42.630 --> 34:43.790
Just answer me truthfully.

34:43.790 --> 34:45.570
I once fell into a human trap,

34:46.480 --> 34:48.840
and my mouth was caught
in a narrow-necked bottle.

34:48.840 --> 34:50.320
Lord Heiwu saved me.

34:53.150 --> 34:54.750
Though I've repaid the debt,

34:55.440 --> 34:56.699
asking me to betray him

34:57.440 --> 34:58.440
is impossible.

34:59.280 --> 35:01.550
You certainly know how to repay kindness,

35:01.550 --> 35:03.080
valuing loyalty above all.

35:04.320 --> 35:06.050
But have you ever thought about

35:07.760 --> 35:10.420
where those minor demons
who once honored you as their teacher,

35:10.420 --> 35:12.020
and respected and loved you,

35:13.550 --> 35:15.030
are now?

35:19.760 --> 35:22.190
What exactly is going on
between Heiwu and the Feiyu Guard?

35:22.190 --> 35:23.790
Stop wasting words, Hong Ye.

35:24.200 --> 35:25.590
If you don't kill me today,

35:25.590 --> 35:27.390
one day, I will kill you.

35:29.440 --> 35:30.570
Do you hate me so much

35:31.800 --> 35:33.760
that you would harm your own kind?

35:36.320 --> 35:37.670
Hate is not the word.

35:38.630 --> 35:40.010
Throughout history,

35:40.330 --> 35:41.930
be it humans or demons,

35:42.760 --> 35:43.820
when power shifts,

35:44.540 --> 35:46.510
only when the previous ruler dies,

35:47.590 --> 35:49.920
can the successor secure their position.

35:50.890 --> 35:52.450
What if I lost my power

35:53.590 --> 35:54.760
and posed no threat?

35:55.920 --> 35:57.650
Would you still want to kill me?

35:58.150 --> 35:58.920
Yes.

35:59.670 --> 36:00.280
Why?

36:01.440 --> 36:03.570
As long as you were once the Demon Lord,

36:03.880 --> 36:05.320
you must be eliminated.

36:24.760 --> 36:25.320
Water.

36:28.510 --> 36:29.510
I want some water.

36:35.670 --> 36:37.190
I'm not doing this

36:37.190 --> 36:38.790
because I feel sorry for you.

36:57.630 --> 36:58.180
Luoluo.

36:59.440 --> 37:00.110
Luoluo.

37:01.360 --> 37:02.070
Could you

37:02.670 --> 37:03.930
loosen this a bit?

37:05.550 --> 37:06.030
I

37:06.500 --> 37:07.610
can't breathe.

37:08.510 --> 37:09.510
Just a little bit.

37:10.270 --> 37:11.640
You betrayed our kind.

37:11.870 --> 37:13.130
Why should I trust you?

37:13.990 --> 37:15.900
Now that Hong Ye has returned,

37:16.480 --> 37:18.180
and I'm in this state,

37:19.350 --> 37:20.750
what could I possibly do?

37:21.320 --> 37:22.000
Luoluo.

37:22.360 --> 37:23.470
For the sake of our

37:24.280 --> 37:26.140
teacher-student relationship,

37:26.180 --> 37:27.640
and how we're both demons,

37:27.900 --> 37:28.770
please?

37:29.350 --> 37:31.320
Please, please.

37:31.850 --> 37:32.650
Just a little.

37:33.330 --> 37:34.400
Just a tiny bit, okay?

37:34.400 --> 37:35.000
Fine.

37:49.310 --> 37:50.720
I'll tie it back up.

37:53.800 --> 37:54.150
You!

37:54.150 --> 37:55.450
How could you trick me?

37:58.200 --> 37:59.290
You're just too stupid.

37:59.290 --> 38:00.890
Blame your own foolishness.

38:01.190 --> 38:02.590
You think you can stop me?

38:03.400 --> 38:03.760
Get out of my way.

38:03.760 --> 38:05.070
You can't leave!

38:05.090 --> 38:05.780
Luoluo.

38:06.460 --> 38:08.460
I don't want to hurt you. Step aside.

38:08.550 --> 38:10.150
Otherwise don't blame me for being rude.

38:10.150 --> 38:11.460
My Lord said

38:11.510 --> 38:12.670
demons must stand united.

38:12.670 --> 38:14.150
I cannot let you go.

38:14.360 --> 38:17.090
Another one
of Hong Ye's manipulative speeches.

38:17.150 --> 38:18.350
You pig-headed fool.

38:25.920 --> 38:26.770
My Lord.

38:27.280 --> 38:27.880
It's fine.

38:31.320 --> 38:32.250
You're injured.

38:39.710 --> 38:41.110
As the mighty Demon Lord,

38:41.670 --> 38:43.190
why shield a minor demon?

38:43.190 --> 38:44.150
You once said,

38:45.150 --> 38:46.550
only when the ruler dies,

38:47.190 --> 38:49.050
can the successor become stable.

38:49.760 --> 38:51.000
But in my view,

38:51.670 --> 38:52.440
power

38:53.110 --> 38:54.550
is granted only to those

38:55.190 --> 38:56.850
who treat all beings equally.

38:58.120 --> 38:59.900
Though we dislike humans,

39:00.660 --> 39:02.400
they have a good saying:

39:03.690 --> 39:05.770
"Heaven and Earth are not benevolent,

39:05.770 --> 39:07.440
treating all beings as mutt dogs."

39:07.440 --> 39:08.780
If the ruler

39:09.320 --> 39:10.380
doesn't sincerely

39:11.050 --> 39:12.850
and equally care for all demons,

39:14.440 --> 39:15.400
how could there still be

39:15.400 --> 39:17.260
a sanctuary like Demons' Valley?

39:19.550 --> 39:21.430
How could Heiwu and us

39:21.720 --> 39:23.250
still fight for power here?

39:25.240 --> 39:26.500
You are good by nature.

39:27.400 --> 39:29.260
Don't be misled by Heiwu anymore.

40:03.590 --> 40:04.230
Xiao Yao.

40:10.670 --> 40:11.230
Sit.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.920
Why are you injured again?

40:45.360 --> 40:47.160
I just scratched it by accident.

40:48.300 --> 40:50.030
Where did you get it scratched?

40:52.750 --> 40:53.880
In the bamboo grove.

40:58.450 --> 41:00.520
You look very pale.

41:05.440 --> 41:06.440
I haven't been

41:07.030 --> 41:08.030
sleeping well these days.
